(FilterByDateRange end = time.Now(), Local) on a row dated exactly today in UTC:
    TZ=America/New_York   inTruncation=true inBalance=true  (700.00) disagreement=false
    TZ=Asia/Tokyo         inTruncation=true inBalance=false (1000.00) disagreement=true
